    <string name="ylog_tips1">Normal scene:The log is used to record regular standby, local services, WCN services, WeChat, web browsing, and equivalent small traffic data traffic scenarios\nData scene:Used to record the exception log generated in the context of using the data business\nAudio scene:An exception log that is used to record a voice business related scene during a call\nWCN scene:Used to record connections such as Bluetooth, WIFI, FM, etc. to manage log generated in related scenarios\nCustom scene:The Log switches of different scenes can be freely combined, and the log generated in any matched scene can be recorded\n\n</string>
    <string name="ylog_tips2">1.Sysdump Enable:The function of this feature is to automatically trigger system dump in case of exception\n2.Location Setting: The default storage location of Ylog is data/ylog, and the user can manually choose to store it in the storage/emulated/0 directory and the root directory of the SD card.</string>
